{'symbol': 'MSI', 'date': '2023-04-11 10:00:00', 'title': 'MOTOROLA SOLUTIONS HOSTS PREMIER PUBLIC SAFETY TECHNOLOGY TRAINING CONFERENCE, SUMMIT 2023', 'text': "CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MOTOROLA SOLUTIONS (NYSE: MSI) TODAY KICKED OFF ITS PREMIER HANDS-ON TECHNOLOGY TRAINING CONFERENCE FOR THE PUBLIC SAFETY COMMUNITY, SUMMIT 2023. THE ANNUAL EVENT CONVENES ONE OF THE INDUSTRY'S MOST COMPREHENSIVE GATHERINGS OF LAW ENFORCEMENT AND GOVERNMENT TECHNOLOGY PROFESSIONALS FOR IN-DEPTH SOFTWARE TRAINING, KNOWLEDGE-SHARING AND CRITICAL DIALOGUE ON MODERNIZING PUBLIC SAFETY OPERATIONS THROUGH TECHNOLOGY."}